    "title": "Genius: AI Photo Generator",
    "description": "Genius: AI Photo Generator is an all-in-one app to generate AI art, remove people from photo, enhance photo quality, extend background. \r\n\r\nWith a rich library of trendy art styles available, this AI photo editor will help ignite your creativity, generating stunning AI-generated images in seconds with simple taps. Anime, cyber-punk, manga, horror, fairy tales, cartoons, you name it! Let\u2019s challenge yourself and see how far you can go with our AI image generator. \r\n\r\n<b>Key Features Of Genius: AI Photo Generator</b>\r\n\ud83c\udfa8AI Image Generator\r\nGenius: AI photo generator will be your go-to AI companion for mesmerizing image transformation. \r\n\r\nSimply upload your photo, choose the style or concept you want, and wait for the vivid art as a result. Think of Genius as your AI character generator, you can AI yourself. You will see yourself in a mesmerizingly new appearance: an all-time favorite fairy tale prince, an anime filter, a slay motorbiker, a warrior in a neon city, or many more. Are you ready for the transformation with this smart AI character generator.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfa8AI Background Generator \r\nThis AI photo editor feature allows you to do AI to expand image while resizing your image. The AI-extended parts will blend seamlessly with your original photo without compromising the quality. Try our AI image extender with a text prompt for more creative results.  \r\n \r\nThis AI background generator also has many aspect ratios available. Choose one that fits your desired platforms or marketing strategies.  \r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfa8AI Object Removal \r\nUndesired objects or people accidentally captured in your photos can be a real nuisance. Genius\u2019s AI photo editing power will help you remove objects, remove people from photo and unwanted distractions in only three steps. \r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfa8 AI Photo Enhancer  \r\nThe AI image enhancer feature increases your images\u2019s resolution and quality, making them sharper and clearer. Using this AI photo enhancer, you can also adjust brightness, contrast, and other parameters to ensure your images stand out with brilliance and clarity.  \r\n\r\nWith Genius, rest assured that our app will enhance photo quality, make photos clear. \r\n\r\n<b>Why Choose Our AI Photo Editor?</b>  \r\n\u2728 All-in-one app: a bunch of advanced features for easy AI art generator and AI editor\r\n\u2728 Advanced AI power: leveraging the latest AI technology out there in the market \r\n\u2728 Highly efficient: intuitive, simple taps, quick generating time, stunning artwork \r\n\u2728 Unless creativity: unleash the artist in you with unless ideas and art creation \r\n\u2728 Frequent updates: frequent updates and improvements, ensure timely access to the latest tools and technologies in the digital photography world. \r\n\r\n<b>All You Need Are Simple Steps</b> \r\n\u2705Tap on the chosen feature \r\n\u2705Upload images \r\n\u2705Tap on \u201cGenerate\u201d \r\n\u2705Download your AI edited images \r\n\r\nLet\u2019s create art the AI way with AI Photo Editor. Our features suit will make your AI art generation effortless and creative. If you have any questions while using Genius: AI Photo Generator please let us know through contact support. Happy editing!",
